OL,3,A'Multi-cancer' blood tests coming to
OL,4,Asome GP surgeries soon
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew blood tests designed to check for
OL,7,Fmultiple cancers in one go will be
OL,8,Foffered to NHS patients in some 200 GP
OL,9,Fsurgeries in England as part of a
OL,10,Ftrial.
OL,12,FThe aim is to detect hard-to-diagnose
OL,13,Fabdominal cancers, including liver,
OL,14,Fovarian and pancreatic cancer, much
OL,15,Fsooner. These cancers are often found
OL,16,Fonly after they have spread.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
