OL,3,A'This is a disaster': Angry Republicans
OL,4,Ablame Trump for midterms defeat
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's on him. It's not on anybody else.
OL,7,FIt's a total, complete rejection of
OL,8,FPresident Trump," Bill Miller, a top
OL,9,FRepublican lobbyist in Texas, told the
OL,10,FBBC. "This is a disaster of the first
OL,11,Fmagnitude. Nobody saw it coming like
OL,12,Fthis."
OL,14,FMost Republicans expected to lose
OL,15,Fcontrol of the House and were
OL,16,Fclear-eyed about the challenge of
OL,17,Fholding onto the Senate in a tough
OL,18,Felection cycle that favoured the party
OL,19,Fout of power.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
