OL,3,ALeft-wing Democrat Abdul El-Sayed wins
OL,4,Ain Michigan to become first Muslim
OL,5,Asenator
OL,6,
OL,7,FRogers, backed by President Donald
OL,8,FTrump, portrayed El-Sayed as a
OL,9,Fcommunist, criticising his stance on
OL,10,FIsrael and his Muslim faith.
OL,12,FAfter waiting long hours, watching the
OL,13,Fwave of Democratic gains across the
OL,14,Fcountry, El-Sayed's supporters
OL,15,Fcelebrated wildly when he took the
OL,16,Fstage to mark his victory.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
